title: 'Invalidate storage transaction cache on state version change'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Fix a cache-bleed bug. The cache stored the pre-computed storage root and transaction
    without recording which trie layout version was used to build them.

    The cache now stores the state version it was built with and the storage root invalidates
    and recomputes whenever a different version is requested.

crates:
- name: sp-state-machine
  bump: patch
